及R05受控原字节factory按已批准顺序仍是依赖，VM死亡规则修复需另按具体语义处理。全37、234动态／2487缺backing／18其他资源及作者生命周期保留范围。\n+**I02完整自动语音合同已获裁决30（2026-10-31）**：源码审计确认粗事件码、source_skill询问或最终武将槽不能证明真实用牌／成本后技能／死亡。三版合同复审已解决历史可见性、qualified资源身份、提交跨度和本地一次消费四类设计缺口，最终No issues／OK with notes仅设计可申请具体授权；用户随后对[审批页](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-public-presentation-contract/approval-request.md)明确批准可缺省S→C presentation、真实Rust投影／易失范围、定义资源binding及参数为空的WASM读取，见[裁决30](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-public-presentation-contract/user-decision30.json)。私有phase1原29文件DTO／可缺省响应／严格入场曾独立审查BLOCK两P1／两P2，原绿测与红审不改；后续30源／11增量修复compound-invalid IPC丢不确定收据、网络保留无界、Rust/TS空白漂移、空泛C→S负控，另补父实际孤立surrogate反例。最终Unicode源码前端441／Rust API-protocol12／type通过，父核源／补丁并解析原日志，独立增量复审No issues，仅限定接纳私有typed-wire基础。见[入口修复证据](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-public-presentation-contract/phase1-ingress-repair/README.md)。所有生产constructor仍None，不产生实际语音事件。父于13:02:52Z在d07推送租约明确释放后按全补丁SHA1b154aa7…精确接30路径至Main工作树（14既有全部匹配5fc、16新路径，和Own6无重叠），Own6／主Cargo.lock／应用期间index保持。**Main typed-wire phase1源码／产品已限定验收，发布候选正修正范围**：初次本地bdaf误含491个测试profile／缓存文件，发布者在任何push／guard之前拦截并撤回；错误叶提交和文件保全本地，另排除四份生成schema备份，只重做未发布候选，父d07及已发布历史不变。新原生1719/0/75、workspace6929/0/77、前端441/type、API-protocol12、独立Gate1b、Worker82／conformance19与crosshash、真实UI12、当前7c2a9f…native／846351…legacy以及实际当前JS的Chromium/SAB、hidden WK/IPC和真实WS执行／同键重放均通过。单次完整preflight21在13:39–13:46封存，父fresh核1054产物／37命令／36源和所有当前产品／保护项，综合复审OK with notes。原报告13比较类勘误为实际12；初始index至门禁33项仅ctime变化由父独立解析确认，来源未知；第一次whole-session raw相等断言失败及误捕获原命令P2保留，追加真正tool命令／结果后P2独立复审关闭，不重跑产品。14:03:47明确解除冻结；14:07接入的CI单文件不冒作原preflight输入。见[Main证据、勘误和边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-main-typed-wire/README.md)。九生产constructor仍None，注入fixture只证consumer、不证Rust producer／真实音频；完整I02和新版本未验收。C29真实激活／provider及R05受控原字节factory按批准顺序仍是依赖；[共享DeathFlow方案](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/README.md)已复核在裁决29内，实施待Damage修复复审。全37、234动态／2487缺backing／18其他资源及作者生命周期保留范围。\n \n \n **NC27已接纳并发布（2026-10-31；5fc0f774，330/105/758/WS6）**：Own可选source_skill及跨端兼容、legacy单字段剥离已按裁决27实施；两独立源码／legacy复审完成，诊断P2经同一445输入18→0差异闭合。父fresh核V2全部43867源码／43836旧Git blob、31增量、58命令与95产物，再核四文件V3增量和Main功能证据。Main原生1715/0/75、前端179／type／外部构建通过；V3最终实际workspace6917/0/77、当前两WASM、native来源／Other隐藏与legacy120步33choices、Worker82／conformance19／轨迹通过，最终完整preflight21／行数自测2／source9003／strict1065零越界全部exit0，父fresh核95证据、当前源码／产品／1927文档和原日志计数通过，组合复审No issues／OK with notes；仅本批source字段限定接纳，已按裁决18入库5fc0f774并按25正常发布；exact-head [CI41183155464](https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/actions/runs/41183155464) attempt1真实10/10，130steps=128success/2skip/0null。父fresh92条SHA/CRC／十完整gzip／API与5次独立live读、独立登记复审均通过，见[本次发布与CI](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/publication-ci/README.md)；旧4dd ten-green不挪作本次。当前仅授权18生成模块更新（未跟踪／ignored构建产品，保留工作树，不强入Git），37默认dist保持；规则330／NGSA105／ABI758／WS6／桌面transport默认WASM不变。私有资源原exit1保留，真实inode差异经既有resources-only修复后两verify新exit0且manifest／catalog／source字节不变。见[字段合同、完整证据及边界](../operations/evidence/2026-10-31-nc10-source-provenance/README.md)。一小时任务TIMEOUT及已存在20分钟检查点分开登记，不冒充测试失败或整体验收；原19 NoCert和NC10 runtime仍BLOCK。"},{"sha":"761f4856f562bed347abb1bcd0ce03007387b342","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/README.md","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2FREADME.md?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# 共享 DeathFlow／provider 后续实施方案\n+\n+核验2026-10-31，基于未变的Main d07／5fc死亡内核和固定两仓上游，以及只读C9冻结源码。实际VM KillPlayer先改HP／alive／dying／日志，后续旧DeathMachine又可能取消／替代／提交，存在两处authority冲突。\n+\n+[方案原文](proposal.raw.txt)及[源码清单](source-inventory.json)提出复用既有栈的单一DeathFlow，保留正HP直接死亡、明确killer操作数和直接die与Damage／Tao救援的区别；真实provider／生命周期／operation LossEnd消费者必须实现，不用元数据壳替代。boss fellow removal不能自动视作death cue。\n+\n+[独立复审](review.raw.txt)No issues／OK with notes：选定机制已在裁决29的DeathFlow、取消／复活、forceDie／forceOut、provider／lifetime范围内；裁决30的audio排除不会撤销29。不重复请求既有授权。实际出现未覆盖的opcode／操作数／无条件kill语义时仍逐项处理边界。\n+\n+本目录只是已审实施计划，未实现或合入Main；当前Damage排序／恢复修复独立审查后再执行。331/106→332/106→R05 333/107及ABI759／WS7顺序不变；完整C331、I02或37来源不因此完成。当前状态见[进度主稿](../../../architecture/native-progress.md)。"},{"sha":"cb98988a943ab819d918801d31638913ee2851bd","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/proposal.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":52,"deletions":0,"changes":52,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fproposal.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fproposal.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fproposal.raw.txt?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+# C29 / I02 dependency: one shared death authority — concrete next-Core plan\n+- Read-only authority: accepted Main `d07b35f94a42b282222dda4ab7bbc5c39ab8fddb`,330/105/758/WS6; `git diff 5fc..d07 -- engine-native-kernel engine-native-content` is empty. Used only the supplied frozen191-path C9 snapshot where present and Main for unchanged files; no live C tree access. CodeGraph is unavailable. [Exact source SHA/inventory](/tmp/c29-vm-death-ea42/source-inventory.json) records named inputs; this is source proof, not executed counterexamples or upstream equivalence.\n+- Immediate next Core task: implement the **already approved C29 DeathFlow/provider lifetime authority** in the existing frame stack, and route native VM direct-die effects through it. Finish/review the exclusive C writer's current pre-HP/chain/restore corrections first; this plan supplies the next coherent slice to that writer, not a competing patch or a reason to import the red C9 snapshot. Frozen C9 still has KillPlayer premutation (`rvm_ops.rs:657–672`) and the old Death stages (`resolution.rs:184–186`); its8 red/3P1 are not this task's fixes.\n+\n+## Authorization: existing29 first, not an automatic new audio approval\n+- Decision29's approved page SHA is `2859f6f07b188b2353a40d1138aa5b69e6c92ca67723e66016a189a8c78c5a0d`. Its item3 explicitly says **“普通死亡只按实际源清临时及离手装备，不清全部永久技能”**; item4 includes **“forceDie／forceOut／blocker／owner snapshots、救援及operation LossEnd按v1真实机制落实”**; item5 covers admitted content cancellation/removal/restore, and item6 authorizes new Core/parser/hash/restore representation. The record conditions say **“schema5 and reviewed Core/parser/hash/restore/phase/damage/grant/reveal/lifetime/Rangjie work authorized”**.\n+- Approved v1's named DeathFlow clause says **“Preserve killer/replacement/revive semantics and ensure cancel/revive stops obsolete remaining death work”** and defers terminal Outcome until After. Approved v3 explicitly supersedes blanket final skill removal: **“DieBefore / DieBegin / cancelled death … Cancellation before committed death performs no death-specific expiry, equipment-drop or persistent-provider cleanup”**, then **“Committed ordinary death → actual die window”**, temporary cleanup/card drops, DieEnd/DieAfter, persistent ownership and ordinary revive. These are concrete Core authorizations, not merely an audio dependency label.\n+- Decision30 explicitly excludes **“VMKillPlayer/DeathMachine genuine semanticrepair needsseparateconcretescope/decision”** and says existing C29/R05 dependencies **“useexistingauthorization; notalreadyimplemented.”** Therefore30 alone grants no such repair, but does not revoke29. The preferred repair below is **inside29** insofar as it implements those already selected source die/cancel/replacement/continuation/provider semantics; the whole-Goal existing-defect mandate also supports removing duplicated native effects. No new user approval is required merely because audio excluded the work.\n+- Exact boundary if review finds a different intended VM contract: introducing an unconditional kill that bypasses dieBefore/cancellation/replacement, a new force-kill flag/opcode, altered killer-default/context meaning, or a new source window absent from the approved finite mapping is **not inferred**. The ready bounded question is: “Should existing kill_player remain a source direct die(reason) request (no damage/no dying-save), honoring the approved death windows/cancel/replacement, with unchanged operands/tag; or is a distinct unconditional execution operation required?” Prefer the former from actual callers below; the latter needs a separately reviewed contract/ABI impact before implementation. Do not ask the user this question unless independent review establishes that actual uncovered boundary.\n+\n+## What current source actually does\n+- Native `engine-native-kernel/src/rvm_ops.rs:655` sets hp=0/alive=false/dying=false and logs PlayerDied **before** emitting EventData::Death. `kernel/death.rs:61/:81` subsequently checks cancellation/substitution, then :130 marks dead again, :139 deletes every skill and :154 logs PlayerDied again; rewards/outcome run at :244/:303. This can produce false early death, suppress owner-alive death eligibility, duplicate death logs and erase permanent providers before genuine death windows.\n+- Main `resolution.rs:110/:169` starts Death in BeforeTriggers, silently skips its AfterTriggers collection (:302), then runs intrinsic DeathMachine; C9 snapshot retains that path (:334). This is not the approved genuine DeathBefore→Begin→die-body→die→cleanup→End/After authority. The existing projector (`engine-native/src/presentation.rs:207`) and coarse code7 (`view.rs:213`) merely consume those logs; neither can certify a genuine death or repair it by deduplication.\n+- All native root emitters found in the named production trees: VM KillPlayer above; DyingSaveMachine `kernel/dying.rs:55` ciqiu no-save and :147 exhausted rescue; native `kernel/phase.rs:206` hxunzhi2 direct die. Ordinary damage/loseHP enters Dying at `kernel/damage.rs:982/:1112`; explicit EnterDying (`rvm_ops.rs:643`) is a different operation. Do not turn any of these distinctions into “all deaths are damage.”\n+- Separate writer: `content/host/boss.rs:146` huanren_remove_mengpo sets alive=false as mode/fellow removal. Do not blindly route every alive=false assignment through death, award a kill or invent a death cue for that removal; classify its source transition separately under the approved mode/provider work.\n+- Current VM plumbing is reusable: effect tag KILL_PLAYER resolves in `rule-vm/src/vm/effects/resolve_qixing.rs:609`, request shape in `rule-api/src/effect/life_cycle.rs:13`, native pending-effect codec tag19 in `rvm_ops/codec.rs:180/:382`. `rvm_bridge/machine.rs:475` removes the effect **before** commit_effect, then yields (:478), allowing the child Death frame to finish before later effects/following handlers. Preserve that placement; do not execute a second engine or enqueue a duplicate effect after restore.\n+\n+## Source-backed direct-die meaning and remaining source differences\n+- Adopted Core HEAD `1a548c95acdf8ac1ef44d74473403eda2ac86cf0`: `player.js:9381` creates die(reason), assigning player/reason/source and content, without mutating alive/hp. `gameEvent.ts:247–289` supplies Before/Begin and End/After. `content.ts:12455–12532` performs actual dead/list state then HP normalization **inside** the die body; :12537 is a mode callback, :12543 is the actual die trigger, :12582 removes temp skills, :12605 awaits actual card losses. Do not confuse the mode callback named dieAfter with the generic After window.\n+- Adopted Liuli HEAD `8485dbb29ff16f9b258a766b1a17ef75f883aade`: monolithic `noname/game/game.js:26626` likewise creates die without premarking; body :21065, die trigger :21156, isDead-guarded temp cleanup :21158–21179 and awaited/stepped card loss :21186–21193 establish the same relevant ordering. This comparison covers these engine paths, not every source mode/revive implementation.\n+- Three current production DSL callers: `ported/offline/sclwansha.skill:4` maps actual Core `character/offline/skill/offline_scl.js:111–124` await target.die(trigger.reason); `ported/wandianlunsha/hanlong.skill:16` maps Core `extension/玩点论杀/character/skill.js:99–105` player.die(); `ported/mobile/laishou.skill:21` maps `character/mobile/skill.js:16650–16673` await player.die() at maxHP≥9. Thus direct-die intentionally skips damage and Tao rescue, even at positive HP; it is not a damage substitute.\n+- Preserve explicit VM killer operands during this root repair. Existing laishou DSL credits self while source die() has no reason/source; ciqiu DSL also supplies event_source despite source player.die(). These are concrete caller/source-attribution differences to fix/register separately, not silently reinterpret all KillPlayer operands or claim this repair proves them equivalent. The compiler's current hover says “immediately kills”; align documentation with the reviewed direct-die child transaction only after the ABI semantics check, without adding a new VM convention.\n+\n+## One preferred implementation sequence for the next Core slice\n+1. **Freeze red fixtures first.** Reuse J2 `pack()/start()/answer()` helpers and real adopted skill packages; capture whole state/events/RNG/provider sets/archive trajectory, not only a boolean or a green count. Keep original105 artifacts/readers intact. Materialize against the C writer's next accepted frozen source; do not overlay these files wholesale on its live damage work.\n+2. **Install one DeathFlow at the existing root.** `kernel/intrinsic.rs:504` selects the approved tagged DeathFlow for EventData::Death. Reuse Frame/Park/Slot::Intrinsic and C29's finite Before/Begin/Commit/After/Finalize/Done continuation (refine internal cleanup substeps as required by genuine child yields). `Ctx.emit` (`machine.rs:319`) and `push_frame` (`resolution.rs:98`) enter the same root; no second queue, registry, per-death counter or generic callback interpreter.\n+3. **Make the VM adapter request, not commit.** Remove only KillPlayer's premature hp/alive/dying changes and PlayerDied append; emit that same Death root with validated victim and existing optional killer mapping. Keep KILL_PLAYER operands/tag/pending-effect codec unchanged, remove-before-yield and wait for the full child subtree. Do not insert EnterDying, damage, a Tao menu or an unconditional HP>0 cancellation: direct die at positive HP is real source behavior.\n+4. **Advance actual windows before mutation.** Dispatch actual DeathBefore, recheck the selected source stop/cancel state, then DeathBegin and its complete child subtree, then recheck cancellation/removal/replacement. Move current inline pre-cancel tian-shu removal (:38) and hutian work (:60) to their actual source-qualified windows; do not leave an early side-effect prefix outside the approved transaction. Preserve mutations explicitly made by genuine child skills when cancelling; cancellation is not a blanket rollback of those children.\n+5. **One actual alive→dead commit.** Only a not-yet-committed DeathFlow whose victim is still the admitted live subject can commit dead/dying state, source HP normalization and one PlayerDied log together. An obsolete parent root returning after a nested child already killed that victim must finish without a second log/reward/drop; a committed flow must still resume its own remaining windows while the victim is dead. Recheck by the **finite stage**, not a global “dead means stop all continuations.” A later genuine revive→death may commit again normally; do not permanently dedup by player ID.\n+6. **Cancel/substitute stays distinct.** A cancelled death emits no committed PlayerDied and performs no automatic death cleanup. The existing Versus substitute branch (:81–118) remains a source-selected replacement/reinit: apply its exact revoke/reassembly/card/deck semantics once, then end obsolete old death work, with no ordinary death reward/outcome/log. If a registered source replacement actually follows committed dieAfter instead, preserve that separate ordering rather than forcing it into the current precommit substitute model; that source trace remains an explicit acceptance item.\n+7. **Use C29 providers for genuine body cleanup.** At actual committed die, retain permanent General/Global/explicit/additional providers and original enabled/counters/storage, then remove only actual Temporary providers/temp:true definitions at the approved cleanup point and await finite onremove children. Await actual death card-loss operations and revoke only Equipment providers as cards leave; keep operation LossEnd whole. Group closure follows provider ownership, not alive. Recheck the source isDead guard after death-window children revive the victim and skip obsolete death-only cleanup, without undoing already performed operations.\n+8. **Finish source order, then outcome.** Keep source-specific death bookkeeping/mode callbacks, actual die window, temporary cleanup/card losses and genuine End/After ordering separate; defer terminal outcome until the full permitted terminal subtree finishes. Migrate current zaoyi/huihuo/rewards/outcome blocks (:158–365) to their actual selected source phase, retaining current registered differences rather than just moving all of them to one new finally block. End is named by approved v3's DieEnd/DieAfter table; if an actual subscriber needs a discriminator absent from v1's Before/Begin/After representation, review that exact finite encoding under29 before adding it—never fold End silently into After.\n+9. **Close obsolete rescue work.** DyingSaveActions/DyingSaveMachine must not consume Tao or emit another Death after a committed direct-die child; a rescue child or replacement must end/recheck the original patient continuation at its real source boundary. Do not infer “rescued” solely from a replacement's positive HP or infer cancellation of direct die from HP recovery alone. Use the approved finite rescue/death stage/result binding; if preserving a child disposition requires an extra persisted field, specify that exact field/codec/invariant in the C patch review rather than borrowing VM locals/marks or adding a new identity counter.\n+\n+## Concrete counterexamples and restore acceptance\n+| Fixture constructor / existing seam | Required assertions |\n+| --- | --- |\n+| J2 VM handler effect kill_player(victim,self), victim HP>0, another living player granted real shiying (`g1_wudian/yueqi.rs:13`) | Before/Begin see a live victim; actual cancel leaves victim alive with source reset state, no committed death log/reward/drop; current VM premark produces a false death. Repeat with actual Kongdongyin cancellation, whose dialog tests are in swd_cards_equip5_b33_lianyaohu_hujing. |\n+| Same VM kill without cancellation; count PlayerDied and reward/card-loss events | Exactly one committed death; current rvm_ops + DeathMachine can append twice. Give a Rebel victim and living killer to detect duplicate draw3/outcome; extend existing `native_kernel/last.rs:46` ordering assertions. |\n+| Reuse Versus fixture with nonempty substitutes and VM direct kill, then exhausted substitute pool | First replacement leaves new general alive with exact reassembly/deck/RNG and no old-victim death cue/reward; exhausted case commits once. Cancellation and replacement must not erase unrelated permanent providers. |\n+| Actual sclwansha / ciqiu_dying / laishou + ordinary Sha/Tao controls | Direct die offers no ordinary rescue, positive-HP laishou still enters death, ordinary Dying can be rescued; committed kill during Dying prevents a second fallback Death. Register current phase/source-attribution differences separately. |\n+| J2 grouped following handler / child-kills-owner tests (`adr0786_j2_review_regressions.rs:155/:232/:304`, cross_target cases176/331/436) | Kill child finishes before later effect; following-handler eligibility and already-admitted C29 Async/step continuation remain distinct; no owner/provider recheck on every await, no resumed double commit/effect. |\n+| Provider lifecycle matrix from approved v3 | General+Temp, Equip+Temp, disabled permanent, Group/additional sharing, revive during die child, actual temp:true removal and finite onremove: preserve exactly the surviving instance/counters/storage; legacy `native_kernel/dying.rs:55–69` expects all skills removed and must be semantically replaced with this approved behavior, not blindly retained/re-recorded. |\n+| Save/byte restore at every prewindow/commit/cleanup-child/drop/After boundary, time_slice1, VM fault/abort | Same full state/log/events/RNG and terminal outcome on continuous/resumed execution, one log/onremove/drop/reward each. Fault/checkpoint rollback removes tentative effects/logs. Logs themselves are not in state/hash, so archive-only restoration cannot recreate historical delivery; formal DeathFlow progress must still prevent repeated state effects. |\n+- Current restore only checks Death victim/killer bounds (`snap/machine_validation.rs:138`), EventData bounds (`snap/validation.rs:143`), parent/depth/slot (`:429`) and reconstructs a stateless DeathMachine (`snap/restore.rs:241`). Add stage↔root/frame identity, admitted victim/killer, cancellation/replacement/commit consistency, pending outcome, provider closure, exact current ask and cleanup-child progress checks; reject impossible early committed/dead state, duplicated commit-capable flow for the same live root, orphan child/bad slot, or cleanup replay claims. Do not reject a legitimate committed dead victim awaiting forceDie/After, nor an already-admitted invocation whose provider was removed.\n+- Synchronize genuine new snapshot/hash/codec: approved DeathFlow shape, `archive/machine_encode.rs`/decode (legacy Death tag11 remains historical), `engine/hash/machine.rs:489`, EventData/DeathWindow codec/hash, physical-card-holder/ask validation and all constructor/match consumers. New106 execution must not restore a legacy stateless Death bypass around the new authority; preserve original105 reader/bytes separately, with no invented migration or tag reuse.\n+\n+## Version, validation and scope disposition\n+- This is formal rule/state work, **not** an I02 presentation-only hash-neutral log edit. The existing C batch reservation331/106 can contain the reviewed finite implementation conditionally, before its actual acceptance; unchanged VM opcode/context meaning and additive reader proof are prerequisites to retaining ABI758/WS6. Do not allocate numbers or collapse331/106→332/106→R05-333/107 (759/WS7); if a later accepted baseline has advanced, build on it rather than reverting versions.\n+- Required future commands after implementation: named new death/provider/VM/rescue and J2/cross-target suites, then full `cargo test --offline -p engine-native-kernel -p engine-native-content -p engine-native`, workspace and corresponding actual matched WASM/IPC/WS6/UI save/restore fixtures. Freeze original failures, inspect first golden divergence for the source semantic reason, and update expectations only after that review. No test/build was executed for this plan.\n+- Remaining unproved branches stay registered: reserveOut/noDieAfter mode variants, Liuli-specific mode replacements/revive, source-attribution mismatches above, Boss fellow removal, every unclassified provider/onremove/zone behavior and out causes, forceDie/source-step eligibility, all37-source differences. This bounded inventory does not turn169 lexical grant matches,191 snapshot paths,262/290 or earlier green tests into semantic completion. I02 typed ingress is independently reviewed private work; no audio producer or full-I02 acceptance follows from this plan.\n+- Recommended next step: independent source-plan review, then the exclusive Core writer's scoped DeathFlow/provider patch with the red constructors above under existing29; escalate only an actual uncovered semantic/ABI/encoding boundary. Skipped all implementation/Main/private-C/I02 code writes, scripts/tests/builds, network, JS execution, performance/devices and playback. Residual risk: cancellation/replacement/cleanup ordering changes formal state and many registered source branches remain unverified."},{"sha":"19686dbccd0973edc0c55e8d446890d3a92f16eb","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/review.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changes":23,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Freview.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Freview.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Freview.raw.txt?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+## Review\n+\n+No issues found.\n+\n+**Merge verdict: OK with notes — proceed as the next scoped C29 Core task after C9b seals and passes review.** This is plan readiness, not acceptance of C9, C331, I02 or a Main merge.\n+\n+- **Correct — Existing authorization applies.** [Decision29](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/noname-next/docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-runtime-contract/user-decision29.json:1) binds approval page `2859f6f0…` and authorizes the reviewed Core/provider/lifetime/restore work. The plan implements those selected death/cancellation/replacement semantics. [Decision30](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/noname-next/docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-i02-public-presentation-contract/user-decision30.json:1) grants no death repair through audio, but preserves existing C29 dependencies. This plan supplies the concrete Core scope; another permission request is unnecessary unless implementation exposes the stated unconditional-kill, operand/context or other uncovered boundary.\n+\n+- **Correct — The root-cause repair matches the source.** Frozen [KillPlayer:655](/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9-final-a_fz1xyd/snapshot/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/rvm_ops.rs:655) mutates HP/alive/dying and appends PlayerDied before emitting Death. The retained DeathMachine subsequently checks cancellation/substitution, commits and logs again. Routing the unchanged request into one shared DeathFlow addresses premature death, suppressed owner eligibility and duplicate effects without presentation-level deduplication.\n+\n+- **Correct — Direct die is distinct from damage and rescue.** Adopted [player.die:9381](/Users/ruyimg/Documents/Claude/sanguosha/archive/upstream/noname/apps/core/noname/library/element/player.js:9381) creates a die event without premarking the victim. The inspected sclwansha, ciqiu_dying and laishou sources support direct death requests, including positive-HP laishou. The plan preserves explicit killer operands and registers attribution/timing drift separately; it does not silently repair those callers or add Tao rescue.\n+\n+- **Correct — VM ordering remains compatible with child execution.** Frozen [pump_commit:475](/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9-final-a_fz1xyd/snapshot/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/rvm_bridge/machine.rs:475) removes the pending effect before committing and yielding. Preserving that sequence lets DeathFlow’s subtree finish before later effects. Existing KillPlayer operands and pending-effect codec tag19 remain unchanged; already-admitted continuation and following-handler eligibility remain separate.\n+\n+- **Correct — Cleanup requires the real shared dependencies.** [Plan steps 4–9](/Users/ruyimg/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-ruyimg-Documents-Claude-sanguosha--/subagent-artifacts/outputs/ea42b092-88ff-4701-affa-cad6e1642d33/proposals/c29-vm-death-shared-authority-plan.md:28) require source-qualified prewindows, actual die, temporary cleanup, awaited card-loss operations, End/After and deferred outcome. They preserve permanent providers/counters/storage, distinguish cancelled death and substitution, and classify Boss fellow removal separately. A DeathFlow wrapper without provider migration and operation LossEnd would not satisfy this plan.\n+\n+- **Correct — Restore cannot retain the old bypass.** Current [Death validation](/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9-final-a_fz1xyd/snapshot/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/snap/machine_validation.rs:144) checks bounds and reconstructs a stateless machine. The plan requires stage/root/slot/child/disposition checks, permits legitimate committed-dead forceDie continuations, and prevents legacy Death tag11 from bypassing new106 execution. DieEnd is already named by approved v3; its finite internal discriminator and concrete codec remain patch-review work under C29.\n+\n+Implementation review should verify the plan’s obsolete-parent rule across nested death followed by revive/substitution, using persisted child disposition rather than an alive/HP check alone. It must also verify source HP-normalization children, cleanup yields and rescue termination; these are acceptance obligations, not newly requested authority.\n+\n+The sequence remains **331/106 → 332/106 → R05-333/107**, with R05 ABI759/WS7 unchanged. No number is allocated here. The plan correctly waits for the exclusive writer, retains original105 artifacts/readers, and leaves source-attribution, mode and all37-source differences open.\n+\n+Skipped implementation, tests, builds, network, JavaScript execution and live C access; no files were written. Supplied hashes were not independently recomputed. Risk remains in the unimplemented shared transaction and its cross-target restore trajectories.\n\\ No newline at end of file"},{"sha":"c9ed4dcec9db9251989282e88d808403bf5538c2","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan/source-inventory.json","status":"added","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changes":37,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fsource-inventory.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fsource-inventory.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-death-authority-plan%2Fsource-inventory.json?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+{\n+  \"authority\": {\n+    \"main\": \"d07b35f94a42b282222dda4ab7bbc5c39ab8fddb\",\n+    \"kernel_content_base\": \"5fc0f77403d90fa4555156bf01722450cbe7bf3b\",\n+    \"kernel_content_git_diff_5fc_to_main\": \"empty\",\n+    \"core_upstream\": \"1a548c95acdf8ac1ef44d74473403eda2ac86cf0\",\n+    \"liuli_upstream\": \"8485dbb29ff16f9b258a766b1a17ef75f883aade\",\n+    \"c9_snapshot\": \"/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-parent-c9-final-a_fz1xyd/snapshot\",\n+    \"live_C_tree_read\": false\n+  },\n+  \"sha256\": {\n+    \"Main/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/kernel/death.rs\": \"e8081ae3578cb5717efe0b4a7cde203659c83fae631588337c0c1f6dbc5467c0\",\n+    \"Main/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/kernel/dying.rs\": \"7d657643ad1086665160dbfb17988c7b3a7be6454a2f3a5dc9d08524a5430fa6\",\n+    \"Main/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/rvm_ops.rs\": \"51ec86fe8b74b185f4aff2d8f7cc3a8a8f8ba73bdefdf532c44d5c1f8668b045\",\n+    \"Main/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/resolution.rs\": \"d18731229a547a03a161c95e46cc3a9dd53ee3843e6f53d56e3137aaede1c104\",\n+    \"C9/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/rvm_ops.rs\": \"e84325da9049a1c49976daf561f09f6959a927128f3c7a844bd04400e2a5b6e5\",\n+    \"C9/crates/engine-native-kernel/src/resolution.rs\": \"bea744ef2730605080f2aac9e22917a637b5543d09ebbfd66c390227da04a338\",\n+    \"Core/noname/library/element/content.ts\": \"09951b61fe8d9199ed1eb8b373faaf206d683e24b2a93a75ffc2259330891e6c\",\n+    \"Liuli/game/game.js\": \"28437fa338ae4c4630929ac535365b508f7068b7f4a1cb393a9568491abb2ea5\",\n+    \"Decision29/approval-request.md\": \"2859f6f07b188b2353a40d1138aa5b69e6c92ca67723e66016a189a8c78c5a0d\",\n+    \"Decision29/proposal-v2.raw.txt\": \"996e77443fdefbfaacfd51c710bad8d270f074d3f2b9cb78528022e1316b08e1\",\n+    \"Decision29/proposal-v3.raw.txt\": \"1fae43770e5d147c08602744473be625a1b930b67022a9638bef81571b3011da\"\n+  },\n+  \"production_kill_player_dsl_declarations\": [\n+    \"content/original/ported/offline/sclwansha.skill:4\",\n+    \"content/original/ported/wandianlunsha/hanlong.skill:16\",\n+    \"content/original/ported/mobile/laishou.skill:21\"\n+  ],\n+  \"native_death_entry_constructors\": [\n+    \"kernel/rvm_ops.rs:655 (VM direct die request, currently premature state/log)\",\n+    \"kernel/kernel/dying.rs:55 (ciqiu no-save)\",\n+    \"kernel/kernel/dying.rs:147 (rescue exhausted)\",\n+    \"kernel/kernel/phase.rs:206 (hxunzhi2 direct die)\"\n+  ],\n+  \"separate_not_ordinary_death_writer\": \"engine-native-content/src/content/host/boss.rs:146 huanren_remove_mengpo mode removal\",\n+  \"qualification\": \"Bounded source inventory only; no scripts/tests/builds/JS/network executed, no 169-match semantic completion claim. Exact paths/lines and acceptance work are in the proposal.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"4329f0081ee53ce8657bdc2912ef3b5458e7142a","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp/README.md","status":"added","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changes":11,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2FREADME.md?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+# C9b：真实 pre-HP driver，最终仍 BLOCK\n+\n+核验2026-10-31，私有5fc+C8+C9叠加，Main无C生产合入；331／106 private／758／WS6。最终46增量manifest e0ef75ea3d3c0a7a77bb2103db36e5b9e23e1f2d146286716d4c971a62c3a174，完整212 manifest d1c89c4cd195e0dc6847bcffbfb3d01f52f6aa6e086ad7649451f14329ded049。见[实现报告](implementation.raw.txt)、[原索引](artifact-index.json)及[父审计](parent-audit.json)。\n+\n+实现既有栈内单一DamageFlow及真实Start→Before→Begin1…4→HP提交→Target／Dying→Source／End／After／Chain；SubmitHp为持久root进度和原子receipt／armor／HP转换，不是新增可订阅事件。chain资格在自身HP转换捕获，仅解当前受害者，后续逐recipient检查alive／linked。\n+\n+初版共享构造误使非Damage Equipped增加BeforeTriggers，原1790/1/75保留；最终scope-fix只共享Damage／Window构造，其他旧入口保持，新增第19项回归通过。最终自然完成原生1791/1/75，唯一golden组12场不符；独立Gate1b0、source9030／unit2／layering0。parent-owned-validation保存已排队full→strict→cheap的原执行结果；父接管既有队列、无PID信号，完成后两PID退出，无新writer竞态。\n+\n+[独立复审](review-two-P1.raw.txt)仍BLOCK两P1：native inline先于First VM handler，恢复子窗自身stage可伪造Intrinsic／BeforeTriggers。原C9三结构问题大部分修复不等同完整Damage正确；golden未重录。下一C9c修复及真实C8逐场语义处置另见[后续证据](../2026-10-31-c331-phase9c-dispositions/README.md)。\n+\n+本目录保存原源码tar／patch／命令／失败／警告及父后补队列结果；旧结果与最终scope-fix结果明确分开，未宣C331／Main／上游规则验收。"},{"sha":"cd67b0ef90de5bcac4bb95864fa7557a0d7bae7a","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp/artifact-index.json","status":"added","additions":2466,"deletions":0,"changes":2466,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fartifact-index.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fartifact-index.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fartifact-index.json?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8"},{"sha":"003b3b2fa5312dc3805cb7a542f03164ba171974","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp/implementation.raw.txt","status":"added","additions":61,"deletions":0,"changes":61,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fimplementation.raw.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fimplementation.raw.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Fimplementation.raw.txt?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@\n+C331 phase9b — actual pre-HP runtime；最后scope修复验证父接管后自然完成；golden仍 BLOCK\n+核验日期2026-10-31；同一private writer，base5fc+C8 repair+C9；无Main导入/写入/stage/commit/push。\n+E=/private/var/folders/b5/2mh_j5tj7m71xhcjsk2z1t4c0000gn/T/noname-c331-phase7-ktqqj1fb/evidence/phase9b。\n+331/NGSA106 unpublished intermediate/ABI758/WS6，format/API1不变；C331 source262/290、remaining28、+0。\n+\n+实际实现与三项P1处理：\n+- Damage root 从 Intrinsic 启动唯一 DamageFlow{root}，Start→Before→Begin→Begin1..4→SubmitHp→HpCommitted→Target→Dying→Source→End→After→Chain→Done。\n+- Before/Begin/Begin1..4/Target/Source/End/After/Zero/Cancelled 都是引用显式root的普通child frame；旧root Before/target队列不再派发。\n+- 仅Damage/Window共用push_frame；Ctx.emit所有nonDamage原构造/起点保留，engine原push起点不改；progress在emit/yield前存好，无第二queue/scheduler/registry。\n+- SubmitHp按父澄清为原子root进度/receipt/armor/HP提交，不发明damageSubmitHp trigger；有receipt的preHP状态拒收，恢复不重施modifiers或扣HP。\n+- canonical root.amount:i32始终是source event.num；committed_damage和hp_loss分离；Some(n)不授后窗权限。\n+- ordinary filter/order refresh/optional gate/start仍共用C7 genuine eligibility/source helper；payload读取统一解析checked root，queue/park保留child身份。\n+- Native pre modifiers拆到Before/Begin/Begin1/Begin4；真实native相德订阅Begin3、兆火来源订阅Begin1；不再一个commit内扁平执行全部前置。\n+- changeHp activation gates/伤逝移至Target前；还侠/极点/冥顽移至After；鼠槌移至End，其余inline End保持其已登记damageEnd角色。\n+- Native host payload消费者全部适配root；乖戾以实际progress区分before/after；并未把Root intrinsic stage冒充旧flat Before阶段。\n+- Source liveness仍逐调度边界刷新；VM采样live root source/amount；未新增HostContext字段/opcode/query/locals/marks ordinal。\n+- HOST_EVENT_AMOUNT保留u32 bits→i32意义；新window kind只在既有Frame/声明绑定中；多handler恢复用真实trigger module+实际frame window双重授权。\n+- chain资格在受伤者自己的HP transition持久化，属性伤害仅unlink当前受伤者；父Dying完整结束后After收集其他linked座位，逐个alive/linked重检。\n+- 不依赖父target晚期仍linked/alive；各child独立root，携带canonical量；飞刃parent2→chain2源证据断言取代旧chain1期望，未重施飞刃。\n+- 新restore矩阵约束receipt/outcome/progress；Completed仅Done，Zero仅ZeroPending/Stopped；Root Flow绑定slot/root/stage/精确depth，window绑定root/progress，Dying绑定target。\n+- 不兼容Completed+HpCommitted、错root、错depth、preHP带receipt/重复commit等受控拒绝；原机Host/OptionalGate字段布局保留。\n+\n+实际测试与失败保留：\n+- initial-red.log真实复现“Before只有flat root queue、没有child/Root Flow”；旧C9 42/191 seals、8红和golden文件全保持不变。\n+- targeted-first/2等编译/消费者失败原文保留；full-native1为1750/37/75，root payload读取漏口修后full-native2为1780/7/75。\n+- targeted9.log：18/0；scope修复前full-native同源亦包含全部18绿。含六个preHP窗和Target逐窗真实pending byte/fulltyped/RNG/继续轨迹比较。\n+- 实际PlayCard+slice1覆盖多handler Begin2挂起、SubmitHp及HpCommitted；该test先暴露UnknownMachine红，修复后完整续行且HP/receipt/log不重复。\n+- 含full armor/无限HP positive amount与zero HP loss；post-submit num0保留receipt但仅Zero；post-submit cancellation有实际Cancelled child且无End。\n+- 含notrigger仍提交HP、Source实际loseHp死亡后End采样sourceNone、LoseHp replacement等待实际Dying子树及byte restore。\n+- 含父真实死亡后chain仍传播、sibling不提前unlink、个体提交后unlink；wrong root/progress/depth/duplicate commit拒绝，原engine完整save不变。\n+- StateSnapshot仅规范化已知restore auth_generation增量；runtime log按既有restore清空语义比较继续suffix，未规范化其他rule字段。\n+- debug_damage+slice不生成正常command checkpoint的fixture红、未flush最后segment完成步的fixture红均保留；正例改用实际PlayCard及完成整个segment。\n+- scope修复前 full-native.log：cargo test --offline -p engine-native-kernel -p engine-native-content -p engine-native --no-fail-fast =1790/1/75，exit101。\n+- 唯一失败仍是replay_scenarios_match_golden：12个原expected mismatch；其余原C9七个非golden失败已修/源证据校正，未删除coverage guard。\n+- A0以exhaustive variant maximum检查完整性；朱羽独立子例重建linked条件；反馈/散财真实optional取消用空selection；redirect后原linked承受者也处理chain窗。\n+- 灵渠零量不派普通damageEnd，正数量只计一次；毒瘟静态源定位跟随damage_windows.rs，既有notLink登记差异未借机隐藏。\n+- scope修复前 gate1b.log：独立target-strict、RUSTFLAGS=-Dwarnings、cargo check --offline -p engine-native --all-targets，exit0。\n+- scope修复前 source-cap-unit/source-caps/layering：2passed、9030files通过1000effective/2000physical、0upward refs。无LSP/WASM/UI/wholeworkspace验收声明。\n+\n+golden和剩余边界：\n+- scope修复前golden-disposition.json保存14场70个snapshot/archive/event/view/choice文件；源码级首个调度差异是root Intrinsic+新增Before child及更多event ids/progress。\n+- 每场与已接受旧轨迹的首个业务语义差异仍未逐一证明；因此原12expected不改、gate保红，不以版本/哈希解释冒充规则等价。\n+- inline intrinsic与普通queued handler的完整上游priority竞争、全部native source绑定归位仍未证明；named DSL/package Begin绑定消费者/SDK parity未宣完成。\n+- 完整forgery矩阵、数值repeat机制、provider/death lifetime/rescue等后续范围不在此轮完成；旧死亡清技能断言不证明v3永久provider契约。\n+\n+冻结与保护：\n+- checkpoint20-v3于约18m09s封存，27files；manifest7b05dc499dc317c8999d58bad69ed7287351d0cc63528324325f598da0867f98；两个freeze脚本失败尝试保留。\n+- 最后审读发现共享构造额外改变Equipped emit起点；已最小修回所有nonDamage原语义，新增第19个构造区分回归；父允许最后短验证例外并接管等待队列。\n+- final-scope-fix 46files：manifeste0ef75ea3d3c0a7a77bb2103db36e5b9e23e1f2d146286716d4c971a62c3a174。\n+- increment tarc0c81922c890f4025464606577b44f1e33f2b785265ba7a8239f976793f8ee58；patcha7b30f28a20ac7575aa69b62c549fb3d17819221355d55a6ff48ddfdc95a8486。\n+- full-source-scope-fix212files：manifestd1c89c4cd195e0dc6847bcffbfb3d01f52f6aa6e086ad7649451f14329ded049。\n+- full tar93df600b6f86b79d2ea77d4c461705ca46338df2a2b4e9d9a054e35fac9e1c5e；patch64eb00896787032f1a927be8503c07086560acd83b6e0f5fe391b726628a1fd6。\n+- 修后两patch reverse-apply通过；旧command-source-bindings.json只绑定pre-fix源751427…，不得冒充修后源e0ef75…已跑全量。\n+- protected-after.json：原Main31867基线不刷新，Own6、父精确I02_30、nativeWASM30e97、d07HEAD/index/docs授权分开登记；其余source/package/dist37/hooks零意外差异。\n+- 原C6_140及C7/C8/repair/C9 indexes fresh逐文件零差异，private old330 generated12固定；private staged empty，无Main验收/CI借用。\n+- 原wrapper/lock/offline/jobs2/incremental0不变；50min后仅父明确允许的已知scope修复短验证例外，无新feature/重试/其他heavy，未清理或signal任何PID。\n+- 修后组13:17排队，foreign workspace62549阻挡约10min；父接管后自然完成。13:30观测full1791/1/75(仅同一golden组)、strict0、unit/caps/F7均0，第19构造回归绿。\n+- 父接管runner82177/wrapper82179及日志，不再起writer直到自然完成并核源；pending-validation-parent-handoff.json记录argv/cwd/父子/等待→实际执行，不重跑producer。\n+- source入口scope-fix-source-binding.json，修后观测scope-fix-results-observed.json；旧results-bound只绑定pre-fix，父保留最终独立核源责任。\n+建议独立复核本46files与矩阵/chain/source绑定，再补12场golden首个语义差异及剩余callback/SDK/source等价证据。\n+跳过平台产物与完整上游等价验收；风险：原golden门禁仍红，修后结果已观测但仍待父独立核源/审阅，完整C9/C331不能报完成或合并。"},{"sha":"a656e51ddbecddcb68cc1d60e1a4db0dcc5d8f1a","filename":"docs/operations/evidence/2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp/original/baseline-c9.json","status":"added","additions":771,"deletions":0,"changes":771,"blob_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/blob/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Foriginal%2Fbaseline-c9.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/raw/34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Foriginal%2Fbaseline-c9.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RuyimgByCN/RuyimgByCN-noname-ruyimg-modified/contents/docs%2Foperations%2Fevidence%2F2026-10-31-c331-phase9b-prehp%2Foriginal%2Fbaseline-c9.json?ref=34e83f0550bb70ef4af6083697428de7be2f02f8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,771 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-31T12:21:14.098133+00:00\",\n+  \"original_c9_index\": \"eb682516e1a635ed963e7aa662f4dac3c622d23fff7645d9dcf48025d0d13c68\",\n+  \"original_c9_manifest\": \"b1571db999a8795e4ff4687eb2b14a10a2772c4ba8b85dd974a89e3f459c4c4f\",\n+  \"files\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"Cargo.lock\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"25b1f2cf1cdec0ce9c2ba7595b59726fb6ed193fdd247893c717ea0b4156fb13\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"apps/desktop-client/src/native_envelope.rs\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"0b05026ccde5a44a59beb288cfff0751d0fb84fc7b8f9b12a9bd1f4c375b9305\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"apps/game-server/src/native.rs\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"db42a408bf346d6684fe1809aec249408593aa6294a4382e0fcd63548b4f837a\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"apps/game-server/src/native_view.rs\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"f6baf8667a67f6e6d8b6b2e48af8e791e4c7b766161c384c1ee0893ffdb0fbfe\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e.rs\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1cd2d770c4fe4b398f015bb41aefc3e64cefe3fd667e3699e48beeabd4547fd7\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"apps/game-server/src/native_ws_e2e/c331.rs\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"5c1b6f8fa15c3c5f71b19ef1bdab412827f3bb91347c7acdcaa54cce32ff511f\"\n